id: pm-rl-loop-panel
title: Bind a separate downstream evaluation panel to built-in trainer receipts
description: The bandit loop submits a trainer-seed digest and sampled held-out score. Fixed-plan promotion requires its comparison digest and exact candidate mean. Agents using generation promote can submit the sealed score today. A built-in trainer needs a separate binding to use an additional workflow panel while preserving its primary evidence.
